linux-nvidia (7.3.0-1001.1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * stonking/linux-nvidia: 7.3.0-1001.1 -proposed tracker (LP: #2171274)

  * MediaTek MT8901: SBSA watchdog causes resets around system suspend
    (LP: #2169002)
    - NVIDIA: SAUCE: watchdog: sbsa_gwdt: park the watchdog around system
      sleep on MediaTek implementations
    - NVIDIA: SAUCE: watchdog: sbsa_gwdt: stop MT8901 ping worker during
      suspend

  * MT8901: firmware-described EINT wake sources can remain masked
    (LP: #2170130)
    - NVIDIA: SAUCE: pinctrl: mt8901: sync wake EINT event mask

  * linux-nvidia-bos: incomplete CXL enum breaks builds with CONFIG_CXL_BUS=n
    (LP: #2169549)
    - NVIDIA: SAUCE: cxl: Fix enum forward declaration

  * Packaging resync (LP: #1786013)
    - [Packaging] update variants

  * CXL: Restore Type 3 memory by accepting firmware-committed zero-size HDM
    decoders (LP: #2171032)
    - NVIDIA: VR: SAUCE: cxl: Do not reject committed zero-size HDM decoders

  * cxl: Kernel panic in cxl_probe_component_regs() when the CXL HDM cache
    probes an unassigned BAR (LP: #2170528)
    - NVIDIA: VR: SAUCE: cxl: Do not probe HDM registers on unassigned BARs

  * [linux-nvidia]: nvme-rdma: GDS scatterlist can be undersized for GPU I/O
    (LP: #2170268)
    - NVIDIA: SAUCE: nvme-rdma: size NVFS SGL for GPU pages
    - NVIDIA: SAUCE: nvme-rdma: size NVFS SGL per bio

  * BPMP debugfs population significantly delays boot on Vera (LP: #2170236)
    - firmware: tegra: bpmp: Allow BPMP debugfs population to be skipped

  * UBUNTU: [Config] nvidia: default KHO off on arm64 (LP: #2168816)
    - [Config] nvidia-bos: default KHO off on arm64

